    <section class="empire-glance" id="at-a-glance" aria-labelledby="glance-title">
      <div class="empire-glance-main"><h2 class="empire-glance-title" id="glance-title">At a glance</h2><ul><li>A highland kingdom of central Madagascar, reunited by Andrianampoinimerina, who made Antananarivo its capital around 1794.</li><li>Radama I's alliance with <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#britain">Britain</a> from 1817 let it conquer much of the island as the Kingdom of Madagascar.</li><li><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#france">France</a> invaded in 1883–85 and 1895 and abolished the monarchy in 1897, exiling Queen <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#ranavalona-iii">Ranavalona III</a>.</li></ul></div>
      <aside class="empire-dyk"><p class="empire-dyk-title">Did you know?</p><p>Merina markets used Spanish and French <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#silver">silver</a> dollars cut into small fragments and weighed on tiny scales, rather than counted as whole coins.</p></aside>
    </section>

